  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Green thumb class feature, poison use class feature</p>\n<p>You've been working on a wrist technique, and it's finally bearing fruit.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain the following green thumb ability.</p>\n<p><em>Rapid Poisoning (Su):</em> As a swift action, the herbalist applies a recipe or plant that is treated as though it were a poison to a weapon. This ability costs 1 green thumb point.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/herbalism-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
